}^{2}{e}^{\\lambda t}+3\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda t}-10{e}^{\\lambda t} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda t}({\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -10) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -10 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda +5)(\\lambda -2)=0,\n$$\n\nand so the solutions of the auxiliary equation  are $\\lambda =-5$ or $\\lambda =2.$\n\nTherefore, any linear combination of the functions ${e}^{-5t}$ and ${e}^{2t}$ is a solution to the original differential equation. \n\nAmong the given options, only $-3{e}^{-5t}+2{e}^{-2t}$ is not a solution." 13194139534608 17592186045417 true] [17592186427573 1058 #edb/ref 17592186427575 13194139534608 17592186045417 true] [17592186427573 1062 #uuid "2c217041-6e07-5b2b-ab0b-44e2beb8265c" 13194139534608 17592186045417 true] [17592186427573 1063 #edb/ref 17592186079206 13194139534608 17592186045417 true] [17592186427574 1062 #uuid "90c0dd24-f5ff-5d53-a9db-2ea11550684f" 13194139534608 17592186045417 true] [17592186427574 1063 #edb/ref 17592186357470 13194139534608 17592186045417 true] [17592186427575 1058 #edb/ref 17592186427574 13194139534608 17592186045417 true] [17592186427575 1062 #uuid "b72723e4-6cca-52eb-af62-fa6496045372" 13194139534608 17592186045417 true] [17592186427575 1063 #edb/ref 17592186427572 13194139534608 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-227e8665-3923-5e3b-9f94-01de1d340546" 17592186427565 "answer-3bda799f-2dc1-508a-b332-a2dc15ad6469" 17592186427566 "answer-463b0c74-3f5f-5ede-984f-20e81cf9dab4" 17592186427567 "answer-6a3822e6-4ea3-5bd8-88d6-1f35c1d51f37" 17592186427568 "answer-bbd12f7d-a1de-5498-8a07-57a3b71dfca4" 17592186427569 "answer-e0c2bf7c-2f4c-5e0e-8a59-5fd6f0e6f6d1" 17592186427570 "answer-field-8f1bdcac-c8f7-5ea7-bb80-b176a1307c71" 17592186427571 "question-128c4108-f47c-515a-aaac-ed93eb92e39c" 17592186427572 "step-2c217041-6e07-5b2b-ab0b-44e2beb8265c" 17592186427573 "step-90c0dd24-f5ff-5d53-a